  "title": "Vertiv to Open Software Center at Centerra in Loveland, Colo.",
  "summary": "Vertiv, a leader in critical infrastructure for data centers, communication networks and commercial and industrial facilities, will open a software and data analytics center of excellence at Centerra in Loveland, Colo. The center, which will employ 100 data scientists, software developers and other professionals, is slated to open in August and will help Vertiv better serve customers globally and provide a hub for customers on the West Coast.",
